# Build output — regenerated inside the image; copying it in also risks
# a stale jar shadowing the one the builder stage produces.
build/
.gradle/
out/
bin/

# Runtime data. uploads/ is a mounted volume in compose; baking a
# developer's documents into an image is both slow and a data leak.
uploads/

# web/ is NOT listed here, deliberately. It is build output like build/
# above, and the same reasoning would exclude it — but it is output from the
# *sibling* repository that this build context cannot otherwise reach, staged
# by scripts/stage-browser-app.sh precisely so the image can carry it
# (ADR 15). Excluding it produces an image that starts and 404s every page.

# VCS and IDE
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Python artefacts from running the converter locally
converter/__pycache__/
converter/.pytest_cache/
**/*.pyc

# Docs and local scripts — not needed to build or run
*.md
start.sh
start.bat
docker-compose*.yml

# Never copy secrets into a build context
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
